 end="1:06.769" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.921" end="1:01.785">只是些无意义的</span><span begin="1:01.785" end="1:02.269">平</span><span begin="1:02.269" end="1:02.822">常</span> <span begin="1:03.230" end="1:04.391">有意无意</span><span begin="1:04.391" end="1:04.854">地</span><span begin="1:04.854" end="1:05.144">欣</span><span begin="1:05.144" end="1:06.769">赏</span></p><p begin="1:07.065" end="1:12.693" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.065" end="1:07.757">读错</span><span begin="1:07.757" end="1:08.037">一</span><span begin="1:08.037" end="1:08.757">番</span> <span begin="1:08.757" end="1:08.967">又</span><span begin="1:08.967" end="1:09.659">在</span><span begin="1:09.659" end="1:10.001">念</span><span begin="1:10.001" end="1:10.554">念</span><span begin="1:10.554" end="1:10.910">不</span><span begin="1:10.910" end="1:12.693">忘</span></p></div><div begin="1:12.703" end="1:39.128" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:12.703" end="1:19.294" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.703" end="1:13.760">也许</span><span begin="1:13.760" end="1:14.299">你</span><span begin="1:14.299" end="1:15.307">是我</span><span begin="1:15.307" end="1:15.733">哄</span><span begin="1:15.733" end="1:16.502">我</span> <span begin="1:17.378" end="1:17.828">的</span><span begin="1:17.828" end="1:19.294">谎</span></p><p begin="1:19.916" end="1:26.778" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.916" end="1:22.209">好借你想起</span><span begin="1:22.209" end="1:22.615">我</span><span begin="1:22.615" end="1:23.137">还</span><span begin="1:23.137" end="1:23.625">有</span> <span begin="1:24.666" end="1:25.168">遗</span><span begin="1:25.168" end="1:26.778">憾</span></p><p begin="1:27.674" end="1:31.897" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.674" end="1:28.803">你从来</span><span begin="1:28.803" end="1:29.891">只是</span><span begin="1:29.891" end="1:30.364">远</span><span begin="1:30.364" end="1:31.897">方</span></p><p begin="1:32.753" end="1:39.128" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agen